-- companion-party-overhaul: the campfire (CampFire NPC, npc/companion_life.txt) draws the
-- client's own bonfire sprite under a mod id, since this client has no row for the stock
-- 4_BONFIRE id. 3.2.0: the companion pets (db/mob_db.yml 31201-31213) use the real
-- monsters' sprites. Only these rows; the app merges them into the client's own table by id.
-- 3.10.1: the pets use quiet copies in data/sprite/<monster>/cpo_pet_*.spr/.act (the stock
-- sprites with the stand and walk frames' sounds removed; attack, hurt and die keep theirs).
-- The client mutes real pets, but ours are monsters, so the idle sounds played nonstop.
-- Made by tools/make_quiet_pets.ps1 from the client's data.grf.
